## Part 1 (L4) — the universe constructor

`build_universe(seed)` → raw close, adjusted close, dollar volume,
actions, planted (the ground truth). Requirements: 50 tickers,
~10 years daily, cross-sectionally correlated (corr≈0.4) with a
drift spread; dollar volumes spanning ~$5M–$2B. Plant, on DISJOINT
tickers: 5 late listers, 3 early delisters, 2 halt gaps (5 days),
1 stale series (price frozen + zero volume for 120 days), 1 crash
day (−35%), and on two clean tickers: one 2:1 split and four $0.80
dividends (raw/adjusted must follow the day-2 conventions exactly —
the cross-checks will test the identities).

