## Hints

- Part 1: assign defect tickers from a permutation (disjoint by
  construction); NaN regions are applied AFTER events so nothing
  collides; split before copying adjusted, or you will halve the
  wrong side (a +100% phantom in adj — test it).
- Part 3: classify by NaN-pattern geometry: leading block = late
  lister, trailing block = delister, interior run = halt; stale =
  long zero-volume run; cross-checks use the day-1/2 identities.
